==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|aska|lang=non}}. Confer the Old English ''[[æsce]]'', the Old High German ''[[asca]]'' and the Swedish ''[[#Swedish|aska]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈasɡ̊a]|lang=is}}

